{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60102","type":"text","text":"# 🗺️ 深度学习实战进阶大通关\nUNet · YOLOv1 · FaceNet 自研路线图","x":-280,"y":-380,"width":560,"height":90},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60304","type":"text","text":"🟢 第一阶段\nUNet 图像分割\n像素级抠图","x":-500,"y":-60,"width":220,"height":90,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60405","type":"text","text":"🔹 Encoder-Decoder\n对称收缩-扩张结构\n下采样提取语义 → 上采样还原分辨率","x":-500,"y":80,"width":220,"height":120},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60506","type":"text","text":"🔹 Skip Connection\n跨层级特征拼接\n`torch.cat(..., dim=1)`\n挽救丢失的边缘细节","x":-500,"y":400,"width":220,"height":160},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60607","type":"text","text":"🔹 ConvTranspose2d\n转置卷积上采样\n从低分辨率 → 高分辨率\n学习上采样权重","x":-500,"y":630,"width":220,"height":135},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60708","type":"text","text":"🔹 Dice Loss\n解决类别不均衡\n背景大 · 病灶小\n计算预测轮廓与GT重合度","x":-500,"y":815,"width":220,"height":145},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f61213","type":"text","text":"📚 UNet 学习资源\n📺 霹雳吧啦Wz UNet源码解析\n📄 U-Net (2015) 原始论文\n🔗 milesial/Pytorch-UNet","x":-500,"y":1080,"width":220,"height":200},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60203","type":"text","text":"🏗️ 前置基础\n反向传播 · Softmax分类器\nBasic/Advanced CNN · ResNet残差\n双向GRU变长序列 · Adam优化器","x":-160,"y":-240,"width":320,"height":120,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60809","type":"text","text":"🟡 第二阶段\nYOLOv1 目标检测\n高维张量的回归暴政","x":-110,"y":-60,"width":220,"height":90,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60d0e","type":"text","text":"🔴 第三阶段\nFaceNet 度量学习\n万物皆可 Embedding","x":330,"y":-60,"width":220,"height":90,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f6090a","type":"text","text":"🔸 ResNet50 骨干网络\n`torchvision.models.resnet50`\n提取图像特征\n末端接全连接层","x":-110,"y":80,"width":220,"height":160},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60e0f","type":"text","text":"🔺 CNN特征截断\n任意标准CNN (如Inception)\n砍掉Softmax分类头\n`Linear(..., 128)` 映射层","x":330,"y":80,"width":220,"height":200},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f61011","type":"text","text":"🔺 Triplet Loss\n三元组: Anchor·Positive·Negative\nL = max(d(A,P)-d(A,N)+α, 0)\n拉近同类 · 拉远异类","x":330,"y":630,"width":220,"height":135},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f61112","type":"text","text":"🔺 度量学习应用\n128维 Embedding\n人脸验证 · 人脸聚类\n无需固定类别数","x":330,"y":815,"width":220,"height":145},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f61415","type":"text","text":"📚 FaceNet 学习资源\n📺 吴恩达 人脸识别章节\n📄 FaceNet (2015) 原始论文\n🔗 timesler/facenet-pytorch","x":330,"y":1080,"width":220,"height":200},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60f10","type":"text","text":"🔺 L2归一化\n`F.normalize(p=2, dim=1)`\n锁定在单位球面上\n空间几何坐标","x":330,"y":400,"width":220,"height":160},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60b0c","type":"text","text":"🔸 多任务复合损失\n位置中心点误差\n宽高根号误差\n置信度误差 + 分类误差","x":-110,"y":630,"width":220,"height":135},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60c0d","type":"text","text":"🔸 IoU & NMS\n交并比计算\n非极大值抑制\n过滤重复检测框","x":-110,"y":815,"width":220,"height":145},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f61314","type":"text","text":"📚 YOLOv1 学习资源\n📺 Aladdin Persson 纯手写教程\n📺 吴恩达 目标检测章节\n📄 YOLOv1 (2015) 原始论文","x":-110,"y":1080,"width":220,"height":200},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60a0b","type":"text","text":"🔸 7×7×30 输出张量\nS×S网格划分\n30通道 = 2×(5) + 20类\nx,y,w,h,confidence","x":-110,"y":400,"width":220,"height":160},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f61516","type":"text","text":"🚀 下一步：Transformer 体系\nAttention 机制 · ViT · 多模态\n将卷积组装经验迁移至注意力机制","x":-200,"y":1400,"width":400,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f61617","type":"file","file":"基于pytorch的深度学习/Deep Learning advance/unet-yolo-facenet study plan.md","x":-660,"y":1640,"width":1320,"height":2400}
	],
